  "metadata_synthesis": "1971 Kubrick provocation. Dystopian delinquency. A deeply polarizing thesis on free will and violence.",
  "setting_and_subculture": "Bleak, brutalist London futurescape. Milk bars. Sterile rehabilitation centers. Vandalized upper-class homes.",
  "visual_tone_and_feel": "Stark white bowler hats. Grotesque phallic art. Wide-angle lens distortions. Unsettling symmetrical framing.",
  "media_era_tone": "1970s cynical ultraviolence. Post-hippie pessimism. Transgressive arthouse shock cinema.",
  "pacing_and_structure": "Tripartite structure. Joyful anarchy to clinical subjugation to ironic restoration. Exhaustingly visceral.",
  "atmosphere_and_mood": "Sadistic, cold detachment. Claustrophobic paranoia. Grotesquely cheerful depravity.",
  "themes_and_messages": "The necessity of choice. State-sanctioned torture vs individual evil. The failure of behavioral conditioning.",
  "character_relationships": "Treacherous teenage gang dynamics. Predatory gang leaders. Vengeful victims. A manipulative, apathetic state.",
  "lead_character_type": "Charismatic psychopath. Beethoven-loving rapist. Government guinea pig. The ultimate red flag favorite character.",
  "story_and_plot_type": "Dystopian satire. Reverse revenge narrative. Psychological horror.",
  "who_and_when": "A near-future totalitarian state. Roving droogs. Exploitative politicians.",
  "emotional_evocation": "Deep moral revulsion. Nausea-inducing discomfort. Conflicted fascination. A sudden hatred of milk.",
